# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Supabase → Project Settings → Data API (URL) and
# API Keys (anon / publishable).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars are inlined into the JS bundle at build time, so treat both
# values as public. The anon key is meant to be shipped; every table it can
# reach must be protected by row-level security on the server. Never put the
# service_role key in this file.
#
# Metro caches env vars — restart with `npx expo start --clear` after editing.

